    "title": "Wolf reintroduction update Part 2: - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorial ,\n7 hours ago Releases in Gunnison County this winter appear unlikely. The biggest issue right now for the Colorado Parks and Wildlife commission (CPW) gray wolf reintroduction program, assigned to the commission by a voter-passed ballot measure in 2020, appears to be finding an approved source for wolves to bring to Colorado this year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
